      {
        "@value": "The Pearl Theater @ The Pearl Theater - May 16, 2026"
      }
    ],
    "http://opengraphprotocol.org/schema/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Come see SoS at the spot they first began performing at their inception three years ago. They will be performing for an annual fundraiser for the Western Montana Musician's Co-op, giving back to the community that first welcomed them in in the Mission Valley. All proceeds go to this wonderful local organization."
